WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.000
This video covers templates.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.790
SOAP note templates shape
the clinical record.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:08.070
Discharge templates shape
what the client takes home.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.950
Open Templates to see
your practice's templates,

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.190
your own, and the ones noctune includes.

00:00:14.315 --> 00:00:17.105
Switch to the Discharge tab
for discharge templates.

00:00:17.827 --> 00:00:20.947
Other clinicians share templates
in the community library.

00:00:20.947 --> 00:00:24.057
Filter by type, and
open one to preview it.

00:00:24.147 --> 00:00:28.377
If it suits your practice,
choose Add to, then My templates.

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:31.497
Open your copy to adjust it and save.

00:00:32.013 --> 00:00:36.483
To build your own, choose New
template, the plus beside search.

00:00:36.653 --> 00:00:40.243
Copy an existing template,
start blank, or import.

00:00:40.253 --> 00:00:43.843
Name it, choose Create,
then edit and save.

00:00:44.507 --> 00:00:46.737
Already have a template in a document?

00:00:46.827 --> 00:00:50.577
Choose Import, paste it,
and choose Organize this.

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.897
noctune turns it into a draft.

00:00:53.227 --> 00:00:55.217
If part of it is written for clients,

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:57.857
noctune offers to make
that a discharge template.

00:00:57.947 --> 00:00:59.937
Nothing is saved until you choose Save.

00:01:00.413 --> 00:01:03.763
Email Templates hold client
education you send often.

00:01:03.853 --> 00:01:05.773
Choose a template to preview it.

00:01:05.773 --> 00:01:08.653
Placeholders, like the
patient's name, fill in when

00:01:08.653 --> 00:01:11.283
you send, and the
Placeholder button adds more.

00:01:11.827 --> 00:01:14.227
Templates you set up on the
web are ready on iPhone.

00:01:14.227 --> 00:01:15.897
Choose them before you start recording.
